Duvy
====

Independence
------------
Duvy is an independent desktop media client. This repository does not contain code copied from
other media clients; it is a separate implementation written in Rust and TypeScript.

Duvy is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Nuvio Media, Trakt, Jellyfin,
Emby, Stremio, TMDB, Real-Debrid, AllDebrid, Premiumize, TorBox, any other debrid provider, or
any addon author. Optional integrations talk to those services using their public APIs and the
credentials the user supplies. Those services have their own terms and privacy policies.

